}

params:query {
  topic_id: 1
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{access_token}}
}

docs {
  # GET /lessons
  
  Retrieves lessons for a topic.
  
  ## HTTP Method & Route
  - **Method:** `GET`
  - **Route:** `/wp-json/tutor/v1/lessons`
  
  ## Authentication
  - **With Bearer JWT:** user must be able to view the parent course.
  - **Without JWT:** allowed only when the parent course is **public**.
  - Permission for JWT callers comes from the bound API key (`Read`, `Read/Write`, or `All`).
  
  ## Query Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
  | `topic_id` | `integer` | **Yes** | Parent topic post ID. Registered as a required REST arg; omitting it typically yields WordPress `rest_missing_callback_param` before the controller runs. |
  
  ## Notes — outline vs full DTO
  
  - **Outline** (guests / non-enrolled on locked courses): `ID`, `post_title`, `post_name`, `post_type`, optional `duration`.
  - **Full** (enrolled / unlocked / instructor): `ID`, `post_title`, `post_content`, `post_name`, `topic_id`, `attachments`, `thumbnail`, `video`.
  
  ## Responses
  
  ### 200 OK — full lesson (enrolled / unlocked)
  ```json
  {
    "code": "tutor_read_lesson",
    "message": "Lesson retrieved successfully",
    "data": [
      {
        "ID": 301,
        "post_title": "1.1 Setting Up Your Development Workspace",
        "post_content": "Full instructional text and transcript...",
        "post_name": "1-1-setting-up-workspace",
        "topic_id": 201,
        "attachments": [
          "http://tutor-dev.local/wp-content/uploads/starter-kit.zip"
        ],
        "thumbnail": "http://tutor-dev.local/wp-content/uploads/lesson-thumb.jpg",
        "video": [
          {
            "source": "youtube",
            "source_video_id": "",
            "poster": "",
            "source_external_url": "",
            "source_shortcode": "",
            "source_youtube": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=example",
            "source_vimeo": "",
            "source_embedded": "",
            "runtime": {
              "hours": 0,
              "minutes": 10,
              "seconds": 0
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
  ```
  
  `video` is the stored `_video` post meta (`get_post_meta(..., false)`), so it is an **array** of the internal meta object (`source` + `source_youtube`, etc.) — not the Pro write-API `{ source_type, source }` shape.
  
  ### 200 OK — outline
  ```json
  {
    "code": "tutor_read_lesson",
    "message": "Lesson retrieved successfully",
    "data": [
      {
        "ID": 301,
        "post_title": "1.1 Setting Up Your Development Workspace",
        "post_name": "1-1-setting-up-workspace",
        "post_type": "lesson",
        "duration": "00:10:00"
      }
    ]
  }
  ```
  
  ### Missing `topic_id` (WordPress validation)
  ```json
  {
    "code": "rest_missing_callback_param",
    "message": "Missing parameter(s): topic_id",
    "data": {
      "status": 400,
      "params": ["topic_id"]
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ### No lessons
  ```json
  {
    "code": "tutor_read_lesson",
    "message": "Lesson not found for the given topic ID",
    "data": {
      "status": 404
    }
  }
  ```
}
